Package: cantrip-os-recovery
Version: 0.5.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Cantrip <support@cantrip.dev>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: cantrip-os-workspaces (>= 0.3.0), cantrip-os-executor (>= 0.9.0), python3, passwd
Description: Optional private workspace capture, reset and recovery for CantripOS
 Bounded root administration commands for coordinated workspace capture and
 staged restore, selected home reset and retained-original rollback.
 The existing external Cantrip Worker owns orchestration,
 encryption, authorization and backup storage. No agent or network listener
 is installed in the guest.
